Evaluate one normalized host operation from stdin

Usage: shield __internal enforce-request [OPTIONS] --project <PROJECT>

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>              Owning enrolled project fixed by the trusted host launcher
      --json                           Print one JSON result; commands that change policy refuse JSON mode
      --debug-log-dir <DEBUG_LOG_DIR>  Write private per-process diagnostics in this directory (also `SHIELD_DEBUG_LOG_DIR`)
      --no-debug-log                   Disable diagnostic logging, including automatic debug-build logs
      --cache-dir <CACHE_DIR>          Compiled cache location for init, MCP setup or cache preparation
  -h, --help                           Print help
